# DarshanEase Backend — Architecture & Future Scope

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| **Language** | TypeScript (ES2022, strict mode) |
| **Runtime** | Node.js |
| **Framework** | Express 4 |
| **Database** | MongoDB Atlas via Mongoose 8 |
| **Auth** | JWT (`jsonwebtoken`) + `bcryptjs` |
| **Validation** | Zod (env config), manual checks in controllers |
| **Media** | Cloudinary (dependency present, not yet deeply integrated) |
| **Dev tools** | `ts-node-dev` (hot-reload), `tsc` for production builds |

---

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── server.ts            ← Entry point: connects to MongoDB, starts Express
├── app.ts               ← Express app: registers CORS, JSON parsing, all routes
├── config/
│   └── env.ts           ← Zod-validated environment config (PORT, MONGODB_URI, JWT_SECRET)
├── models/              ← Mongoose schemas (4 collections)
│   ├── user.model.ts
│   ├── temple.model.ts
│   ├── slot.model.ts
│   └── booking.model.ts
├── middlewares/
│   └── auth.middleware.ts  ← JWT `protect` guard + `requireRole(...)` RBAC guard
├── services/            ← Business logic layer
│   ├── auth.service.ts     ← Register / Login (bcrypt + JWT)
│   └── booking.service.ts  ← Slot validation + atomic booking creation
├── controllers/         ← Request handlers (7 files)
│   ├── auth.controller.ts
│   ├── temple.controller.ts
│   ├── slot.controller.ts
│   ├── booking.controller.ts
│   ├── payment.controller.ts
│   ├── admin.controller.ts
│   └── templeAdmin.controller.ts
├── routes/              ← Express routers (7 files, maps 1:1 to controllers)
│   ├── auth.routes.ts
│   ├── temple.routes.ts
│   ├── slot.routes.ts
│   ├── booking.routes.ts
│   ├── payment.routes.ts
│   ├── admin.routes.ts
│   └── templeAdmin.routes.ts
└── scripts/             ← CLI seed & maintenance utilities
    ├── seedTemples.ts      ← Seed 6 famous Indian temples
    ├── seedSlots.ts        ← Generate 15-min time slots for each temple
    ├── seedSuperAdmin.ts   ← Create default superadmin user
    ├── seed-slot.ts        ← Legacy single-temple slot seeder
    └── cleanupOldData.ts   ← Wipe old bookings (migration helper)
```

