## API Surface

### Public (No Auth)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/temples` | List all active temples |
| `GET` | `/api/temples/:id` | Get temple details |
| `GET` | `/health` | Health check |

### Devotee (Auth Required)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/auth/register` | Register new devotee |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/login` | Login |
| `GET` | `/api/slots?date=&templeId=` | Browse available slots |
| `POST` | `/api/bookings` | Create booking directly |
| `GET` | `/api/bookings` | My confirmed bookings |
| `POST` | `/api/payments/simulate` | Simulated payment → booking |

### Temple Admin (`templeAdmin` role)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/temple-admin/stats` | Temple dashboard stats |
| `GET` | `/api/temple-admin/temple` | Get own temple info |
| `PUT` | `/api/temple-admin/temple` | Update own temple |
| `GET` | `/api/temple-admin/slots` | List temple's slots |
| `POST` | `/api/temple-admin/slots` | Create new slot |
| `PUT` | `/api/temple-admin/slots/:id` | Update a slot |
| `DELETE` | `/api/temple-admin/slots/:id` | Delete a slot |
| `GET` | `/api/temple-admin/bookings` | View temple bookings |

### Super Admin (`superadmin` role)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/admin/stats` | Global dashboard stats |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/users` | List all users |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/users/:id` | User detail |
| `PATCH` | `/api/admin/users/:id/role` | Change user role |
| `DELETE` | `/api/admin/users/:id` | Delete user |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/temples` | Create temple |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/temples/:id` | Update temple |
| `DELETE` | `/api/admin/temples/:id` | Delete temple + cascade slots |
| `PATCH` | `/api/admin/temples/:id/toggle` | Activate / deactivate |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/bookings` | All bookings (filterable) |

